msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assessmentScoreValueFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:assessmentScoreValue and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:assessmentScoreValue (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:assessmentScoreValue 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:assessmentScoreValue 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/assessmentTargetFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:assessmentTarget and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:assessmentTarget (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:assessmentTarget 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:assessmentTarget 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/observedFeature|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The individual whose property or state is being observed — the feature of interest. The range is intentionally open (logic:Thing — the OWL/RDFS projection renders it as the W3C OWL Thing top type) because anything can be observed: a place, a person, an event, a document, a quality value, or a situation. SHACL shapes enforce closed-world constraints per observation kind."
msgstr "其属性或状态正被观察的个体——即关注的特征。其值域被有意保持开放（logic:Thing——OWL/RDFS 投影将其呈现为 W3C OWL Thing 顶类型），因为任何事物都可被观察：一个地点、一个人、一个事件、一份文档、一个质量值或一种情形。SHACL 形状按观察种类施行闭世界约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/vantage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "gmeow:vantage ⊑ gmeow:accordingTo: the reified relator edge is semantically subsumed by the annotation-property axis. This is NOT asserted as rdfs:subPropertyOf because gmeow:accordingTo is authored as a logic:AnnotationProperty (its generated OWL/RDFS projection is the W3C OWL AnnotationProperty) while vantage is a logic:ObjectProperty — keeping the OWL 2 DL downcast clean on that projection, Principle 3. The subsumption is documented here and realised in the projection layer, not axiomatised in the reasoned core."
msgstr "gmeow:vantage ⊑ gmeow:accordingTo：具体化关系边在语义上被注解属性轴所包含。这并未被断言为 rdfs:subPropertyOf，因为 gmeow:accordingTo 被写作 logic:AnnotationProperty（其生成的 OWL/RDFS 投影是 W3C OWL AnnotationProperty），而 vantage 是 logic:ObjectProperty——从而在该投影上保持 OWL 2 DL 下转的洁净，原则 3。该包含关系在此处被记录并在投影层实现，而非在被推理的核心中公理化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Refinement"
msgstr "细化观测"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An observation made by a named, versioned process reading another record, with that record as observed feature and the process as vantage. Results are new readings, never edits to the source."
msgstr "由具名且有版本的过程读取另一记录而形成的观测；被读记录是观测对象，该过程是观测视角。结果是新的解读，而非对来源的修改。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:reading a gmeow:Refinement ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:record ; gmeow:vantage ex:refinerV2 ."
msgstr "ex:reading a gmeow:Refinement ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:record ; gmeow:vantage ex:refinerV2 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A process reading, not world determinacy, evidential support or a formal linguistic denotation. Different process versions and vantages retain separate records."
msgstr "这是过程的解读，并非世界的确定性、证据支持或形式语言指称。不同过程版本和视角保留各自的记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid mutating the source or treating a selected reading as an automatically asserted source fact."
msgstr "不要修改来源，也不要将选定解读自动当作来源事实来断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the source and versioned vantage, record refinementOutcome, and put selected individuals or derived observations in observationResult. Keep unselected alternatives in refinementCandidate."
msgstr "标明来源和有版本的视角，记录 refinementOutcome，并把选定个体或派生观测放入 observationResult。未选候选保留在 refinementCandidate 中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for record interpretation such as mention resolution, time joins or narrative readings performed after the source was recorded."
msgstr "用于来源记录形成之后进行的提及消解、时间关联或叙事解读等记录解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Refinement Outcome"
msgstr "细化结果"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The qualitative outcome of a process reading: resolved, best guess, ambiguous or unresolved. This axis describes the reading rather than the truth of its subject."
msgstr "过程解读的定性结果：已确定、暂定最佳、存在歧义或未能解读。该维度描述解读，而非其对象的真值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:refinementAmbiguous a gmeow:RefinementOutcome ."
msgstr "gmeow:refinementAmbiguous a gmeow:RefinementOutcome ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Outcome values are individuals, not subclasses, and are distinct from Determinacy and SupportStatus. The four supplied values do not assign a numeric probability."
msgstr "结果值是个体而非子类，且不同于 Determinacy 和 SupportStatus。提供的四个值不指定任何数值概率。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a reading outcome as a truth value or a calibrated confidence score."
msgstr "不要将解读结果用作真值或经校准的置信分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select an outcome individual through refinementOutcome on the corresponding Refinement."
msgstr "通过 refinementOutcome 将结果个体关联到相应 Refinement。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish how far a recorded interpretation progressed."
msgstr "用于区分记录中的解释进行到了哪一步。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "refinement outcome"
msgstr "细化结果"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a refinement to the qualitative outcome of its reading. Nonfunctional so coexisting attributed outcomes are retained."
msgstr "将细化观测关联到其解读的定性结果。关系非函数性，以保留并存的不同归属结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:reading gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."
msgstr "ex:reading gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This reports the process outcome, not the evidence grade of a claim. A distinct process version should have a distinct refinement record."
msgstr "它记录过程结果，而非陈述的证据等级。不同过程版本应具有各自的细化观测记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a default outcome from missing data or silently choosing between competing attributions."
msgstr "不要从数据缺失推导默认结果，也不要暗中挑选相互竞争的归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach the explicit outcome value and preserve the vantage that attributed it."
msgstr "附上明确的结果值，并保留作出该归属的视角。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when recall must distinguish a resolved reading from a guess, ambiguity or failure to resolve."
msgstr "当检索需要区分确定解读、猜测、歧义或未能消解时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "refinement candidate"
msgstr "细化候选"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a refinement to an unselected candidate reading or referent. Naming a candidate neither selects it as a result nor asserts the statement it reifies."
msgstr "将细化观测关联到尚未选定的候选解读或指称对象。命名候选既不将其选为结果，也不断言其所具体化的语句。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:ambiguous gmeow:refinementCandidate ex:readingA, ex:readingB ."
msgstr "ex:ambiguous gmeow:refinementCandidate ex:readingA, ex:readingB ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional and deliberately not a subproperty of observationResult or candidateHypothesis. The latter belongs to an InferenceCommitment, not a generic process reading."
msgstr "该关系非函数性，且有意不作为 observationResult 或 candidateHypothesis 的子属性。后者属于 InferenceCommitment，而非一般过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting all candidate contents or treating candidate existence as a selected answer."
msgstr "不要断言所有候选内容，也不要把候选的存在当成选定答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each alternative from the refinement; if it is propositional, use RDF 1.2 reification without asserting its quoted content."
msgstr "从细化观测指向每个备选；若候选是命题，使用 RDF 1.2 具体化且不断言其中引用的内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for ambiguous or otherwise unselected reading alternatives that must remain queryable."
msgstr "用于需要保留可查询性的歧义候选或其他未选解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved reading"
msgstr "已确定解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process selected one reading with adequate confidence for its declared task."
msgstr "过程以足够满足其声明任务的信心选定了一个解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementResolved ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementResolved ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Resolution belongs to this process and source scope; it is not a guarantee of world truth or universal agreement."
msgstr "确定性属于该过程及来源作用域，不保证世界真值或普遍共识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using resolved status to erase another vantage or bypass source provenance."
msgstr "不要借已确定状态抹去其他视角或绕过来源信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record the selected target or derived observation through observationResult."
msgstr "通过 observationResult 记录选定目标或派生观测。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when one sufficiently supported reading was selected."
msgstr "当选定了一个得到足够支持的解读时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "best-guess reading"
msgstr "暂定最佳解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process provisionally selected one reading without the confidence required for resolved status."
msgstr "过程暂时选定一个解读，但其信心尚不足以使用已确定状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A qualitative provisional selection, not a prescribed credence number or a claim of certainty."
msgstr "这是定性的暂时选择，并非指定的信念度数值或确定性宣称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a numeric probability from this value or presenting the answer without its provisional status."
msgstr "不要从该值编造数值概率，也不要隐去答案的暂定状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the selected result and expose the best-guess outcome to consumers that hedge or request confirmation."
msgstr "保留选定结果，并向需要保留余地或请求确认的使用方暴露暂定最佳状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when one reading is useful but remains a guess."
msgstr "当某个解读有用但仍属猜测时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ambiguous reading"
msgstr "歧义解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process retained several candidate readings without selecting one."
msgstr "过程保留多个候选解读，尚未选定其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementAmbiguous ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementAmbiguous ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Candidate multiplicity is explicit and is not resolved by graph order, label matching or a privileged vantage."
msgstr "候选的多重性是明确的；不能通过图顺序、标签匹配或特权视角自动消解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying every candidate into selected results."
msgstr "不要把每个候选都复制到选定结果中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "List alternatives with refinementCandidate and leave a selected result absent until a reading is actually chosen."
msgstr "用 refinementCandidate 列出备选；在实际选定解读之前不填写选定结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when several readings remain and recall should ask which was meant."
msgstr "当多个解读仍然并存，检索应询问所指为何时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "unresolved reading"
msgstr "未能解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process produced no reading in the recorded source and task scope."
msgstr "过程在所记录的来源和任务作用域内未产生解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementUnresolved ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementUnresolved ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An explicit process outcome, not missing data and not proof that no interpretation exists."
msgstr "这是明确的过程结果，不是数据缺失，也不证明不存在任何解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a result node merely to fill an unresolved record."
msgstr "不要仅为填满未能解读的记录而捏造结果节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain source and versioned vantage, record this outcome and omit a selected result."
msgstr "保留来源和有版本的视角，记录该结果，并不填写选定结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a completed reading attempt found no interpretation."
msgstr "当一次已完成的解读尝试未找到解释时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Encounter"
msgstr "相遇观察"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An observation that its vantage met another agent, with the meeting event as its observed feature."
msgstr "观察者与另一行动者相遇的观察，以会面事件为所观察的对象。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:encounter a gmeow:Encounter ; gmeow:vantage ex:observer ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:meeting ."
msgstr "ex:encounter a gmeow:Encounter ; gmeow:vantage ex:observer ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:meeting ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The observation and the meeting are distinct nodes; participants, time and place belong to the event."
msgstr "观察与会面是不同节点；参与者、时间和地点属于事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not replace a meeting event with its observation or infer friendship from an encounter."
msgstr "不要以观察替代会面事件，也不要从相遇推断友谊。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind vantage and observedFeature; query the event participants and eventTime for first-meeting recall."
msgstr "绑定 vantage 和 observedFeature；查询事件参与者与 eventTime 以检索首次会面。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Encounter|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when recall must identify an observed meeting with someone."
msgstr "用于需要检索与某人相遇的观察记录时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "encountered in"
msgstr "相遇于"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates an encounter observation to the conversation or message in which the meeting occurred."
msgstr "将相遇观察关联到会面发生于其中的对话或消息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:encounter gmeow:encounteredIn ex:conversation ."
msgstr "ex:encounter gmeow:encounteredIn ex:conversation ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The target is a referenced record or interaction, not a verbatim external identifier or a spatial location."
msgstr "目标是被引用的记录或交互，不是外部标识符字面量或空间地点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not use this relation instead of observedFeature for the meeting event."
msgstr "不要用此关系替代指向会面事件的 observedFeature。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Point to the conversation or message node and retain the separate observed meeting event."
msgstr "指向对话或消息节点，并保留独立的会面事件。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/encounteredIn|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when an encounter happened through a recorded conversation."
msgstr "用于相遇发生在有记录的对话中时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "witnessed locus"
msgstr "见证地点"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The location at which an observation was witnessed, including a place in a simulated world."
msgstr "观察被见证时所在的地点，包括模拟世界中的地点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:observation gmeow:witnessedLocus ex:virtualRoom ."
msgstr "ex:observation gmeow:witnessedLocus ex:virtualRoom ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Specializes locatedAt for the observing record; the observed event may carry a separate event location."
msgstr "这是观察记录的 locatedAt 特化；被观察的事件可具有另一个事件地点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not infer a geographic place or conflate the witness location with the location of every observed object."
msgstr "不要推断为地理地点，也不要将见证地点与每个被观察对象的位置混同。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Link a Location and retain hasReferenceFrame on the observation and the simulated place."
msgstr "关联 Location，并在观察和模拟地点上保留 hasReferenceFrame。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedLocus|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the place of witnessing is part of an observation receipt."
msgstr "用于观察凭据需要保留见证地点时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "witnessed at head"
msgstr "见证状态头"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The immutable state-head identifier witnessed by an observation within its selected environment frame."
msgstr "观察在所选环境参考框架内见证的不可变状态头标识符。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:observation gmeow:witnessedAtHead \"state-42\"^^xsd:token ."
msgstr "ex:observation gmeow:witnessedAtHead \"state-42\"^^xsd:token ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An opaque token scoped by the environment frame, not a universal digest, time or mutable latest alias."
msgstr "这是以环境框架为作用域的不透明词元，不是通用摘要、时间或可变的 latest 别名。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Do not compare head tokens across different environments without their frame identities."
msgstr "不要在缺少框架身份时跨环境比较状态头词元。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record the exact stable token together with hasReferenceFrame and witnessedLocus."
msgstr "同时记录精确稳定词元、hasReferenceFrame 与 witnessedLocus。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/witnessedAtHead|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when replay needs the environment state that was actually witnessed."
msgstr "用于重放需要实际见证的环境状态时。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Policy finding"
msgstr "策略发现"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An observation by a named policy process about a judged claim, with a policy-defined finding as its result."
msgstr "具名策略进程针对受评断言作出的观察，其结果是该策略定义的发现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:finding a gmeow:PolicyFinding ; gmeow:vantage ex:policyV2 ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:claim ; gmeow:observationResult ex:speakerMismatch ."
msgstr "ex:发现 a gmeow:PolicyFinding ; gmeow:vantage ex:策略V2 ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:断言 ; gmeow:observationResult ex:发言者不匹配 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A finding records the policy perspective; it neither asserts the judged claim nor mandates rejection of a write."
msgstr "发现记录策略的视角，既不认可受评断言，也不要求拒绝写入。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for admission, attribution or disclosure findings that must themselves retain provenance."
msgstr "用于自身也必须保留来源的准入、归属或披露发现。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating a policy result as an unattributed truth or silently substituting it for the original claim."
msgstr "不要将策略结果视为无归属的真理，也不要用它悄然替代原始断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/PolicyFinding|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the versioned policy as vantage, the judged claim as observedFeature and an explicit finding kind as observationResult."
msgstr "以 vantage 标明带版本的策略，以 observedFeature 标明受评断言，以 observationResult 标明明确的发现类型。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Disclosure decision"
msgstr "披露决定"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An observation of how a policy treats a particular claim for a particular reader."
msgstr "关于策略如何为特定读取者处理特定断言的观察。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:view a gmeow:DisclosureDecision ; gmeow:disclosureReader ex:reader ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:claim ; gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureNonAcknowledgement ."
msgstr "ex:视图 a gmeow:DisclosureDecision ; gmeow:disclosureReader ex:读取者 ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:断言 ; gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureNonAcknowledgement ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The decision is private policy evidence, not automatically part of the reader view. Different readers and policy versions retain distinct decisions."
msgstr "决定是私有的策略证据，不会自动成为读取者视图的一部分。不同读取者及策略版本各自保留独立决定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to record an explicit reader-relative release or withholding outcome."
msgstr "用于记录针对读取者的明确发布或隐藏结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid leaking a hidden claim through its decision record or inferring an outcome from missing metadata."
msgstr "不要通过决定记录泄露隐藏断言，也不要从缺失元数据推断结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureDecision|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Bind disclosureReader, observedFeature, policy vantage and a DisclosureOutcome through observationResult; apply the selected policy before emitting any reader-visible record."
msgstr "绑定 disclosureReader、observedFeature、策略视角，并通过 observationResult 指定 DisclosureOutcome；输出任何读取者可见记录前先应用所选策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "disclosure reader"
msgstr "披露读取者"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The reader principal for whom a disclosure decision was made."
msgstr "披露决定所针对的读取者主体。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:decision gmeow:disclosureReader ex:alice ."
msgstr "ex:决定 gmeow:disclosureReader ex:小明 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The reader is separate from the claim observer, the signing agent and the policy vantage."
msgstr "读取者与断言观察者、签名代理及策略视角相互独立。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to bind a decision to its explicitly selected reader."
msgstr "用于将决定绑定到明确选定的读取者。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using reader identity as observer attribution or as proof of authorization."
msgstr "不要将读取者身份当作观察归属或授权证明。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReader|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the reader Agent on the decision; retain separate decisions when another principal receives a different view."
msgstr "在决定中标明读取者 Agent；另一主体获得不同视图时保留独立决定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Disclosure outcome"
msgstr "披露结果"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An explicit result of applying a disclosure policy for a reader, including release and distinct forms of withholding."
msgstr "对读取者应用披露策略得到的明确结果，包括发布及不同形式的隐藏。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:disclosureVisibleRedaction a gmeow:DisclosureOutcome ."
msgstr "gmeow:disclosureVisibleRedaction a gmeow:DisclosureOutcome ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An open result vocabulary, separate from sensitivity, policy posture and truth. No result is implied by absence."
msgstr "开放的结果词汇，与敏感性、策略立场及真值分离。缺失不隐含任何结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for the individual-valued result of a DisclosureDecision."
msgstr "用于 DisclosureDecision 的个体值结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid treating the result as permission to bypass the selected reader policy."
msgstr "不要将结果当作绕过所选读取者策略的许可。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/DisclosureOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference an outcome individual through observationResult and preserve the reader and policy that produced it."
msgstr "通过 observationResult 引用结果个体，并保留产生结果的读取者及策略。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "released to reader"
msgstr "向读取者发布"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The selected reader policy permits emitting the claim in its authorized projected form."
msgstr "所选读取者策略允许以获授权的投影形式输出断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:decision gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureReleased ."
msgstr "ex:决定 gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureReleased ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Release may still require coarsening or suppression of fields under the policy; it is not a public-release flag."
msgstr "发布仍可能要求按策略降低精度或隐藏字段，并不表示公开发布。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when this reader may receive the policy-selected projection."
msgstr "用于该读取者可以接收策略选定投影的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid extending one reader permission to other readers or the unprojected source."
msgstr "不要将某个读取者的许可扩展到其他读取者或未投影源数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureReleased|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Emit only the authorized projection and retain the private decision with its reader and policy."
msgstr "仅输出获授权投影，私下保留包含读取者及策略的决定。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "visible redaction"
msgstr "可见遮蔽"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Withhold the protected content while permitting an explicit indication that content was withheld."
msgstr "隐藏受保护内容，同时允许明确显示有内容被隐藏。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:decision gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureVisibleRedaction ."
msgstr "ex:决定 gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureVisibleRedaction ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Acknowledgement itself is a disclosure and must be permitted for this reader."
msgstr "确认存在本身就是披露，必须获准向该读取者提供。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the reader may know that protected content exists."
msgstr "用于允许读取者知道受保护内容存在的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid when even existence, identifiers or result counts must remain hidden."
msgstr "若连存在性、标识符或结果计数也必须隐藏，则不要使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureVisibleRedaction|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Emit only the permitted redaction indicator; omit the protected content and any unauthorized metadata."
msgstr "仅输出获准的遮蔽提示，省略受保护内容及所有未经授权的元数据。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "non-acknowledgement"
msgstr "不确认存在"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Withhold content without revealing to the reader that anything was withheld."
msgstr "隐藏内容，并且不向读取者透露有任何内容被隐藏。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:decision gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureNonAcknowledgement ."
msgstr "ex:决定 gmeow:observationResult gmeow:disclosureNonAcknowledgement ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "The reader-visible graph contains no redaction marker, hidden-claim identifier or decision record that acknowledges the omission."
msgstr "读取者可见图中不得包含遮蔽标记、隐藏断言标识符或确认该省略的决定记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the policy withholds the existence of the protected claim as well as its content."
msgstr "用于策略同时隐藏受保护断言的存在性及内容的情况。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid exposing the private decision, counts or provenance links that reveal the hidden claim."
msgstr "不要暴露会揭示隐藏断言的私有决定、计数或来源链接。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/disclosureNonAcknowledgement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the decision on the policy side and apply non-acknowledgement to every reader-visible surface, including errors and pagination."
msgstr "将决定保留在策略侧，并在所有读取者可见界面上执行不确认存在，包括错误及分页。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Monetary Amount"
msgstr "货币金额"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An exact decimal quantity of money with physical dimension math:dimensionless and one explicit currency ReferenceFrame. It is an abstract math:Quantity value, not an enduring Entity. The shared amount owner serves prices, balances, payments and compensation; identical physical dimensions do not authorize currency conversion."
msgstr "精确十进制货币数量，物理维度为 math:dimensionless，且有一个明确的货币 ReferenceFrame。它是抽象 math:Quantity 值，而不是持存 Entity。此共享所有者用于价格、余额、付款和报酬；相同物理维度不代表允许货币换算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:price a gmeow:MonetaryAmount ; math:quantityValue 19.99 ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:currency gmeow:referenceFrameUSD ."
msgstr "ex:price a gmeow:MonetaryAmount ; math:quantityValue 19.99 ; math:hasDimension math:dimensionless ; gmeow:currency gmeow:referenceFrameUSD ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for an exact price, salary, fee, payment or balance whose currency must travel with its mathematical magnitude."
msgstr "用于货币必须与其数学数值一起传递的精确价格、工资、费用、付款或余额。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid bare monetary literals, a parallel finance amount class, physical unit values, and arithmetic combining different currencies without an explicit conversion contract."
msgstr "避免裸货币字面量、并行金融金额类、物理单位值，以及在没有明确换算契约时对不同货币进行运算。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Type the existing value MonetaryAmount; provide exactly one decimal math:quantityValue, math:hasDimension math:dimensionless, and a complete scalar currency frame through gmeow:currency. Keep observation context on the observing claim."
msgstr "将既有值声明为 MonetaryAmount；提供恰好一个十进制 math:quantityValue、math:hasDimension math:dimensionless，以及通过 gmeow:currency 指定的完整标量货币参考系。观测上下文保留在观测声明上。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/MonetaryAmount|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: the shared observations value owner and canonical math magnitude; currency remains a reference frame, never an eighth SI dimension."
msgstr "范围：共享观测值所有者及规范数学数值；货币始终是参考系，绝不是第八个 SI 维度。"

msgctxt "urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:currency-realm|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "currency-realm contract"
msgstr "currency-realm 契约"

msgctxt "urn:gmeow:finance:constraint:currency-realm|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Requires the declared currency-realm relation for each guarded financial input; the complete frame profile remains owned by places."
msgstr "要求每个受约束的金融输入满足已声明的 currency-realm 关系；完整参考系配置由 places 所有者定义。"
